{"code":"G2","wikidata":"Q104212231","wikipedia":{"en":"Charoen Nakhon station","th":"สถานีเจริญนคร"},"summary":{"en":"Charoen Nakhon station is a Gold Line station, located in Khlong San District, Bangkok, Thailand. The station opened on 16 December 2020. It is located on Charoen Nakhon Road, next to Iconsiam complex and Wat Suwan (th:วัดสุวรรณ (กรุงเทพมหานคร)).","th":"สถานีเจริญนคร เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าแบบยกระดับ ในเส้นทางรถไฟฟ้าสายสีทอง โดยสถานีจะยกระดับเหนือถนนเจริญนคร เขตคลองสาน กรุงเทพมหานคร เป็นสถานีที่ตั้งอยู่ระหว่าง ไอคอนสยาม ทั้งอาคารหลัก และอาคารต่อขยาย"},"opened":"2020-12-16","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Gold_line_G2_station.jpg/960px-Gold_line_G2_station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gold_line_G2_station.jpg","author":"Oum13928","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/A_ride_on_Bangkok_Gold_Line_-_%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%96%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%9F%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87_%28January_2022%29_-_img_02.jpg/960px-A_ride_on_Bangkok_Gold_Line_-_%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%96%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%9F%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87_%28January_2022%29_-_img_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_ride_on_Bangkok_Gold_Line_-_%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%96%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%9F%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87_(January_2022)_-_img_02.jpg","author":"Chainwit.","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/A_ride_on_Bangkok_Gold_Line_-_%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%96%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%9F%E0%B8%9F%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87_%28Janu